{% comment %}
  Therapy flow — Step 2 of 2, "Therapy Details" (node 543:1462). Reached
  from the therapy Continue button on Step 1 of 2 (see
  kal-booking-flow-step-therapy-slot.liquid).

  Same shape as the consultation flow's Patient Details step (name,
  gender, phone, email) — reuses that step's exact data attributes
  (data-kal-field="name"/"phone"/"email", data-kal-gender,
  data-kal-patient-continue) so it shares the SAME patientDetails state
  and isPatientDetailsValid()/updatePatientContinueButton() validation in
  kal-booking-flow.js with zero new JS needed for the form itself — one
  visit's details, collected once, regardless of which flow got here.
  Field ids are still unique per step (kal-therapy-patient-* vs
  kal-patient-*) since both steps' markup sits in the DOM at once (only
  one is unhidden) and duplicate ids would break label-click focusing.

  Gender is Male/Female only, matching Patient Details' own explicit
  instruction (the Figma export for THIS node also showed a third
  "Other" pill — dropped for the same reason, same instruction reused
  here: "for now maintain only male and female").

  The appointment card here is NOT the shared kal-booking-flow-appointment-
  card.liquid — that one shows a mode+price row, which doesn't apply here.
  Instead it shows the real in-clinic doctor for the visitor's own
  facility (loadTherapyDoctorCard() in kal-booking-flow.js, same
  /doctors endpoint + facility lookup as Doctor Select) — the point of
  this card is to make the "your therapy starts with a short doctor
  consultation" line concrete: here's who that doctor actually is. This
  used to be hardcoded to a fake doctor ("Dr. Neethu Jayachandran, BAMS,
  12 yrs experience") shown regardless of facility, then removed outright
  for not being wired to real data — now wired properly instead. The
  photo/name/degree/experience row starts `hidden` and is only revealed
  once real data loads; if the facility has no doctors configured, it
  stays hidden and the card quietly falls back to just the description
  line, same as before this was restored.

  Footer button is "Submit Request", not "Continue" — matches this node's
  own export. It navigates to the new "therapy-confirmed" step (node
  539:2222, the therapy flow's own success screen) once the form is
  valid — a plain data-kal-goto is safe here (unlike Step 1 of 2's own
  Confirm/Continue button) since this button has no separate "confirm
  first" stage; it's just disabled until isPatientDetailsValid().
{% endcomment %}

<div class="kal-step-therapy-details kal-step-shell kal-step-shell--progress-panel">

  {%- comment -%}
    Desktop left column — same pattern as therapy-slot.liquid's own left
    column (see that file's comment) — current_step: 2 now, so "Choose
    therapy" reads Completed and "Personal details" reads In progress.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="kal-step-entry__info kal-step-shell__info kal-concern-select__info">
    <div class="kal-concern-select__info-scroll">
      <div class="kal-concern-select__info-header">
        <h2 class="kal-step-entry__heading kal-concern-select__heading">Therapy Request</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="kal-concern-select__info-section">
        <p class="kal-concern-select__info-label">Selected Clinic</p>
        {%- render 'kal-booking-flow-facility-picker', step_number: 2, location_text: 'Indiranagar', extra_class: 'kal-concern-select__info-pill' -%}
      </div>

      {%- render 'kal-booking-flow-step-progress', current_step: 2, step_names: 'Choose therapy|Personal details' -%}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="kal-step-shell__panel">

    {%- render 'kal-booking-flow-step-header', back_target: 'therapy-slot', step_number: 2, step_total: 2, next_label: 'Final step' -%}

    {%- comment -%}
      Heading + therapy/doctor summary card moved OUTSIDE
      .kal-step-shell__scroll (still siblings within .kal-step-shell__panel)
      per explicit instruction — only the form fields should scroll, with
      these staying fixed right below the progress bar, same treatment as
      Concern Select's own heading/banner.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="kal-step-doctor-select__intro">
      <h2 class="kal-step-doctor-select__heading">Enter your patient details</h2>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%}
      Photo/name/degree/experience row for the facility's real in-clinic
      doctor — see this file's own top comment. Starts `hidden`;
      loadTherapyDoctorCard() (kal-booking-flow.js, called on arrival at
      this step) fills it in from real data and un-hides it, or leaves it
      hidden if the current facility has no doctor to show.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="kal-therapy-appointment-card">
      <div class="kal-therapy-appointment-card__top" hidden>
        <span class="kal-therapy-appointment-card__photo" data-kal-therapy-doctor-photo>
          <span class="kal-doctor-photo-placeholder"></span>
        </span>
        <span class="kal-therapy-appointment-card__body">
          <span class="kal-therapy-appointment-card__name" data-kal-therapy-doctor-name></span>
          <span class="kal-therapy-appointment-card__meta">
            <span class="kal-therapy-appointment-card__meta-item">
              <span class="kal-therapy-appointment-card__meta-icon">
                {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'doctor-education' -%}
              </span>
              <span data-kal-therapy-doctor-degree></span>
            </span>
            <span class="kal-therapy-appointment-card__divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="kal-therapy-appointment-card__meta-item">
              <span class="kal-therapy-appointment-card__meta-icon">
                {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'doctor-experience' -%}
              </span>
              <span data-kal-therapy-doctor-experience></span>
            </span>
          </span>
        </span>
      </div>
      <span class="kal-therapy-appointment-card__desc">
        Your therapy starts with a short <strong>doctor consultation</strong> and is performed by an expert therapist.
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="kal-step-shell__scroll">
      <div class="kal-form">
        <div class="kal-form-field">
          <label class="kal-form-label" for="kal-therapy-patient-name">Full name*</label>
          <input
            type="text"
            id="kal-therapy-patient-name"
            class="kal-form-input"
            data-kal-field="name"
            placeholder="Enter full name"
            autocomplete="name"
          >
          <p class="kal-form-error" data-kal-field-error="name" hidden>
            <span class="kal-form-error__icon">{%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'alert-circle' -%}</span>
            <span data-kal-field-error-text></span>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="kal-form-field">
          <p class="kal-form-label">Gender*</p>
          <div class="kal-gender-group" data-kal-gender-group>
            <button type="button" class="kal-gender-btn" data-kal-gender="female">Female</button>
            <button type="button" class="kal-gender-btn" data-kal-gender="male">Male</button>
          </div>
          <p class="kal-form-error" data-kal-field-error="gender" hidden>
            <span class="kal-form-error__icon">{%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'alert-circle' -%}</span>
            <span data-kal-field-error-text></span>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="kal-form-row">
          <div class="kal-form-field">
            <label class="kal-form-label" for="kal-therapy-patient-phone">Phone Number*</label>
            <div class="kal-phone-input">
              <div class="kal-country-picker" data-kal-country-picker>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  class="kal-phone-input__country"
                  data-kal-country-toggle
                  aria-haspopup="listbox"
                  aria-expanded="false"
                >
                  <span class="kal-phone-input__flag" data-kal-country-flag>
                    {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'flag-in' -%}
                  </span>
                  <span class="kal-phone-input__code" data-kal-country-code>+91</span>
                  <span class="kal-phone-input__chevron">
                    {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'chevron-down' -%}
                  </span>
                </button>
                <ul class="kal-country-picker__panel" data-kal-country-panel hidden role="listbox" aria-label="Country code">
                  <li role="presentation">
                    <button type="button" class="kal-country-picker__option" data-kal-country-option data-kal-country-iso="IN" data-kal-country-dial="+91" data-kal-country-min="10" data-kal-country-max="10" data-kal-country-start="6789" role="option" aria-selected="true">
                      <span class="kal-phone-input__flag">{%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'flag-in' -%}</span>
                      <span class="kal-country-picker__label">India</span>
                      <span class="kal-country-picker__dial">+91</span>
                    </button>
                  </li>
                  <li role="presentation">
                    <button type="button" class="kal-country-picker__option" data-kal-country-option data-kal-country-iso="US" data-kal-country-dial="+1" data-kal-country-min="10" data-kal-country-max="10" data-kal-country-start="" role="option" aria-selected="false">
                      <span class="kal-phone-input__flag">{%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'flag-us' -%}</span>
                      <span class="kal-country-picker__label">United States</span>
                      <span class="kal-country-picker__dial">+1</span>
                    </button>
                  </li>
                  <li role="presentation">
                    <button type="button" class="kal-country-picker__option" data-kal-country-option data-kal-country-iso="GB" data-kal-country-dial="+44" data-kal-country-min="10" data-kal-country-max="10" data-kal-country-start="7" role="option" aria-selected="false">
                      <span class="kal-phone-input__flag">{%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'flag-gb' -%}</span>
                      <span class="kal-country-picker__label">United Kingdom</span>
                      <span class="kal-country-picker__dial">+44</span>
                    </button>
                  </li>
                  <li role="presentation">
                    <button type="button" class="kal-country-picker__option" data-kal-country-option data-kal-country-iso="AE" data-kal-country-dial="+971" data-kal-country-min="9" data-kal-country-max="9" data-kal-country-start="5" role="option" aria-selected="false">
                      <span class="kal-phone-input__flag">{%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'flag-ae' -%}</span>
                      <span class="kal-country-picker__label">United Arab Emirates</span>
                      <span class="kal-country-picker__dial">+971</span>
                    </button>
                  </li>
                  <li role="presentation">
                    <button type="button" class="kal-country-picker__option" data-kal-country-option data-kal-country-iso="SG" data-kal-country-dial="+65" data-kal-country-min="8" data-kal-country-max="8" data-kal-country-start="89" role="option" aria-selected="false">
                      <span class="kal-phone-input__flag">{%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'flag-sg' -%}</span>
                      <span class="kal-country-picker__label">Singapore</span>
                      <span class="kal-country-picker__dial">+65</span>
                    </button>
                  </li>
                  <li role="presentation">
                    <button type="button" class="kal-country-picker__option" data-kal-country-option data-kal-country-iso="MY" data-kal-country-dial="+60" data-kal-country-min="9" data-kal-country-max="10" data-kal-country-start="1" role="option" aria-selected="false">
                      <span class="kal-phone-input__flag">{%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'flag-my' -%}</span>
                      <span class="kal-country-picker__label">Malaysia</span>
                      <span class="kal-country-picker__dial">+60</span>
                    </button>
                  </li>
                  <li role="presentation">
                    <button type="button" class="kal-country-picker__option" data-kal-country-option data-kal-country-iso="AU" data-kal-country-dial="+61" data-kal-country-min="9" data-kal-country-max="9" data-kal-country-start="4" role="option" aria-selected="false">
                      <span class="kal-phone-input__flag">{%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'flag-au' -%}</span>
                      <span class="kal-country-picker__label">Australia</span>
                      <span class="kal-country-picker__dial">+61</span>
                    </button>
                  </li>
                  <li role="presentation">
                    <button type="button" class="kal-country-picker__option" data-kal-country-option data-kal-country-iso="DE" data-kal-country-dial="+49" data-kal-country-min="10" data-kal-country-max="11" data-kal-country-start="1|567" role="option" aria-selected="false">
                      <span class="kal-phone-input__flag">{%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'flag-de' -%}</span>
                      <span class="kal-country-picker__label">Germany</span>
                      <span class="kal-country-picker__dial">+49</span>
                    </button>
                  </li>
                  <li role="presentation">
                    <button type="button" class="kal-country-picker__option" data-kal-country-option data-kal-country-iso="JP" data-kal-country-dial="+81" data-kal-country-min="10" data-kal-country-max="10" data-kal-country-start="789|0" role="option" aria-selected="false">
                      <span class="kal-phone-input__flag">{%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'flag-jp' -%}</span>
                      <span class="kal-country-picker__label">Japan</span>
                      <span class="kal-country-picker__dial">+81</span>
                    </button>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <input
                type="tel"
                id="kal-therapy-patient-phone"
                class="kal-form-input kal-phone-input__field"
                data-kal-field="phone"
                placeholder="10-digit mobile number"
                autocomplete="tel"
                inputmode="numeric"
                maxlength="10"
              >
            </div>
            <p class="kal-form-error" data-kal-field-error="phone" hidden>
              <span class="kal-form-error__icon">{%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'alert-circle' -%}</span>
              <span data-kal-field-error-text></span>
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="kal-form-field">
            <label class="kal-form-label" for="kal-therapy-patient-email">
              Email<span class="kal-form-label__required" data-kal-email-required hidden>*</span>
              <span class="kal-form-label__optional" data-kal-email-optional>Optional</span>
            </label>
            <input
              type="email"
              id="kal-therapy-patient-email"
              class="kal-form-input"
              data-kal-field="email"
              placeholder="Enter email address"
              autocomplete="email"
            >
            <p class="kal-form-error" data-kal-field-error="email" hidden>
              <span class="kal-form-error__icon">{%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'alert-circle' -%}</span>
              <span data-kal-field-error-text></span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kal-step-shell__footer kal-concern-select__footer kal-concern-select__footer--mobile">
      <p class="kal-form-error" data-kal-booking-error hidden>
        <span class="kal-form-error__icon">{%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'alert-circle' -%}</span>
        <span data-kal-booking-error-text></span>
      </p>
      <button type="button" class="kal-step-doctor-select__continue" data-kal-submit-therapy data-kal-patient-continue>
        <span class="kal-button-spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span data-kal-continue-label aria-live="polite">Submit Request</span>
      </button>
    </div>

  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    Desktop-only full-width footer bar, same pattern as the consultation
    flow's progress-panel steps — help text + Back (to Therapy Slot)/
    Submit Request split across the shared 300px/1fr grid columns.
    data-kal-submit-therapy + data-kal-patient-continue on this button:
    patientContinueTrigger (kal-booking-flow.js) still runs the same
    validatePatientDetailsAndShowErrors() check, but routes to
    submitTherapyRequest() instead of a plain goToStep() when this
    attribute is present — see that function for why (real POST to
    /therapy-requests, not just a client-side navigation).
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="kal-step-shell__footer kal-concern-select__footer kal-concern-select__footer--desktop">
    <div class="kal-concern-select__footer-help kal-step-entry__help">
      <span class="kal-icon kal-icon--help">
        {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'help-circle' -%}
      </span>
      <span class="kal-step-entry__help-text">Need assistance? Call us at +91 804012 3456</span>
    </div>
    <p class="kal-form-error" data-kal-booking-error hidden>
      <span class="kal-form-error__icon">{%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'alert-circle' -%}</span>
      <span data-kal-booking-error-text></span>
    </p>
    <div class="kal-concern-select__footer-actions">
      <button type="button" class="kal-step-doctor-select__back kal-concern-select__footer-back" data-kal-back="therapy-slot" aria-label="Back">
        {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'chevron-left' -%}
        <span>Back</span>
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="kal-step-doctor-select__continue" data-kal-submit-therapy data-kal-patient-continue>
        <span class="kal-button-spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span data-kal-continue-label aria-live="polite">Submit Request</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
